-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §26 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מורה ביישום חלקי
-- של הרפורמה: in תשע"ב–תשע"ד, part ג applies to a teacher to whom the
-- reform is applied in part, with these changes — a full position's week of
-- 30, 32 and 36 hours; part-time, mothers and the full age reduction by the
-- annexes for each year; changes of up to 1% and 3% between the stages found
-- no claim; a mother keeping her week is paid on a position 8.6, 8.3 and 7.6
-- points larger, and up to 108.6%, 108.3% and 107.6% needs no approval; the
-- bagrut-preparation and homeroom hours partly in the school, the other role
-- hours in it in full; and the 60-minute hour.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-11`
IMPORT `oz-founding-17`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g1`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g2`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g3`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-a`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b1`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b2`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b3`
IMPORT `oz-founding-12`

§ `26 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מורה ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

DECLARE `Oz section 26 action` IS ONE OF
    `do the year's bagrut-preparation and homeroom hours in the school`
    `do the other role hours within the school, in full`

-- The opening: teachers to whom the reform is applied in part — teachers
-- employed on the reform's terms in schools set to apply it in part, save
-- new teachers — in the school years תשע"ב–תשע"ד. Part ג (§§9–15) applies
-- to them, with (א)–(י)'s changes. How far the reform reaches the teacher
-- in a year is §§6–7's; the rule asks it of the year. A new teacher is
-- under the reform in full (§6(א)) and the opening leaves him out again.
@ref akn:art_26/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`
      `the terms he is employed on` IS A `extent of the Oz reform` @desc as §§6–7 give them for the year
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher in the Oz part application in` y m `the terms he is employed on` IF
        `a year of the Oz part application` y
    AND `a teacher under the Oz agreement` m
    AND `the terms he is employed on` EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`
    AND NOT `a new teaching employee under the Oz agreement` m

§§ `26(א)`

-- (א): the week of such a teacher at a full position (100%): in תשע"ב 24
-- frontal hours, 2 individual and 4 teaching-support hours; in תשע"ג 24, 3
-- and 5; in תשע"ד 24, 5 and 7.
@ref akn:art_26__para_a akn:art_26__para_a/p2 akn:art_26__para_a/p3 akn:art_26__para_a/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz work week`
DECIDE `the full-position week in part application in` y IS
    BRANCH
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5772` THEN JUST (`an Oz week of` 24 2 4)
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5773` THEN JUST (`an Oz week of` 24 3 5)
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` THEN JUST (`an Oz week of` 24 5 7)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours of the full-position week in part application in` y IS
    CONSIDER `the full-position week in part application in` y
    WHEN JUST w THEN JUST (`the hours of the Oz week` w)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- (א): what the teaching-support hours are for, each year — preparing
-- learning materials and checking tests (2, 2, 3), meetings (2 each year),
-- receiving parents (none, 1, 1) and training (none, none, 1) — in the
-- words of §9(ו)(3)'s list, whose kinds they are.
@ref akn:art_26__para_a/p2 akn:art_26__para_a/p3 akn:art_26__para_a/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, a IS A `Oz teaching-support activity`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the weekly teaching-support hours in part application for` y a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `preparing teaching materials and checking work and tests` THEN `by the year of part application` y 2 2 3
    WHEN `work meetings`                                            THEN `by the year of part application` y 2 2 2
    WHEN `talks with parents`                                       THEN `by the year of part application` y 0 1 1
    WHEN `team training`                                            THEN `by the year of part application` y 0 0 1

-- Whether (א)'s kinds of support hour make up the year's support hours.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the support hours of part application add up in` y IF
    CONSIDER `the full-position week in part application in` y
    WHEN JUST w THEN
        sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD fromMaybe 0 (`the weekly teaching-support hours in part application for` y a)) `the teaching-support activities`)
            EQUALS w's `teaching-support hours`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- ¶5 and the table set (א)'s weeks out again "for convenience", year by
-- year: the checks below hold the table to (א).
@ref akn:art_26__para_a/p5 akn:art_26__para_a/t1
`the weeks section 26(א)'s table prints` MEANS
    LIST `an Oz week of` 24 2 4, `an Oz week of` 24 3 5, `an Oz week of` 24 5 7

-- F-oz-founding-26-a: the opening applies part ג "בשינויים הבאים", and
-- none of the changes touches §9(א)'s base of 40 weekly hours, §9(ו)'s
-- "40 השעות" or §9(ד)'s window "לצורך השלמה של מכסת 40 השעות", while (א)
-- composes a full position of 30, 32 or 36. The reading adopted
-- (convention precedence.specific): in the years of part application the
-- base of a full position is (א)'s week, and §9(ד)'s window completes that
-- week, not 40 — as annexes ג'1–ג'3 compute the position on it and §32
-- puts 30, 32 and 36 in place of §15(ב)'s 40.
@ref akn:art_26__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz position base in part application in` y IS
    `the hours of the full-position week in part application in` y

-- §9(ב)'s days, with a long day free, hold 4 × 8 + 5 = 37 hours: more than
-- any year's week, so on the reading adopted §9(ד) has nothing to complete.
`the hours §9(ב)'s days hold with a long day free` MEANS
      (`long working days in the Oz week` MINUS 1) TIMES `the length of the Oz working day` `a long working day`
    + `the length of the Oz working day` `the short working day`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours section 9(ד) completes in part application in` y IS
    CONSIDER `the Oz position base in part application in` y
    WHEN JUST base THEN JUST (max 0 (base MINUS `the hours §9(ב)'s days hold with a long day free`))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `26(ב)`

-- (ב): a part-time teacher in part application works by the week annexes
-- ג'1 to ג'3 set out, one for each year (oz-founding-annex-g1 to -g3): by
-- his frontal hours, with his homeroom and role hours, the week and the
-- position the year's annex and its notes give. A year that is not one of
-- part application has no such annex.
@ref akn:art_26__para_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `a part-time teacher's week in part application` y `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS
    BRANCH
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5772` THEN `what annex ג'1 gives a teacher with` `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5773` THEN `what annex ג'2 gives a teacher with` `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` THEN `what annex ג'3 gives a teacher with` `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- Each year's annex opens at (א)'s full position for the year.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed table`
DECIDE `the annex of part-time weeks in part application in` y IS
    BRANCH
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5772` THEN JUST `the table of annex ג'1`
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5773` THEN JUST `the table of annex ג'2`
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` THEN JUST `the table of annex ג'3`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year's annex opens at section 26(א)'s week` y IF
    CONSIDER `the annex of part-time weeks in part application in` y
    WHEN JUST t THEN `the week of the annexed table's full position` t EQUALS `the full-position week in part application in` y
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

§§ `26(ג)`

-- (ג): for an existing part-time teacher in part application, a change of
-- up to 1% in the position from moving between the stages of the part
-- application founds no claim of a breach of the commitment to the
-- position. "עד 1%" is the most the clause tolerates, so 1% is in (an
-- exception to convention thresholds.until, as in §13(ב)); the change is
-- in points (convention position.points).
@ref akn:art_26__para_c
GIVEN `the position before the move` IS A NUMBER, `the position after the move` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a change of position between stages founds a claim` `the position before the move` `the position after the move` IF
    `the position before the move` MINUS `the position after the move` GREATER THAN 1%
    OR `the position after the move` MINUS `the position before the move` GREATER THAN 1%

§§ `26(ד)`

-- (ד): the week of a mother teacher, and of a teacher entitled to the full
-- reduction of hours for age, is as annexes א'1–א'3 and ב'1–ב'3 set out,
-- respectively, one of each for each year (oz-founding-annex-a1 to -a3 and
-- -b1 to -b3): by the band and the frontal hours, with homeroom and role
-- hours, the week and the positions the year's annex gives — for a mother,
-- of the week she would have had, under §11(א) or (ב). A year that is not
-- one of part application has no such annex.
@ref akn:art_26__para_d
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put him in
      `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `an age-reduced teacher's week in part application` y band `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS
    BRANCH
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5772` THEN `what annex ב'1 gives a teacher with` band `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5773` THEN `what annex ב'2 gives a teacher with` band `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` THEN `what annex ב'3 gives a teacher with` band `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz mother's tables`
DECIDE `the mother's tables in part application in` y band IS
    BRANCH
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5772` THEN JUST (`the mother's tables of annex א'1 for` band)
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5773` THEN JUST (`the mother's tables of annex א'2 for` band)
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` THEN JUST (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put her in
      `frontal hours of the week she would have had` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `a mother's week in part application, keeping her week` y band `frontal hours of the week she would have had` IS
    CONSIDER `the mother's tables in part application in` y band
    WHEN JUST m THEN `what the mother's tables give a mother keeping her week` m `frontal hours of the week she would have had`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put her in
      `frontal hours of the week she would have had` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `a mother's week in part application, cutting her hours` y band `frontal hours of the week she would have had` IS
    CONSIDER `the mother's tables in part application in` y band
    WHEN JUST m THEN `what the mother's tables give a mother cutting her hours` m `frontal hours of the week she would have had`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- Each year's annexes open at (א)'s week for the year, less §12's age
-- reduction off the frontal hours (2 from 50 to 55, 4 over 55) in the age
-- tables and in a mother's (ב) tables of those bands.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz work week`
DECIDE `the full week in part application for the band in` y band IS
    CONSIDER `the full-position week in part application in` y
    WHEN JUST w THEN
        CONSIDER band
        WHEN `the Oz band under 50`      THEN JUST w
        WHEN `the Oz band from 50 to 55` THEN JUST (`the Oz week after the age reduction` w 2)
        WHEN `the Oz band over 55`       THEN JUST (`the Oz week after the age reduction` w 4)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year's mother's tables open at the band's week` y band IF
    CONSIDER `the mother's tables in part application in` y band
    WHEN JUST m THEN `the week of the annexed table's full position` (m's `the table under (ב)`) EQUALS `the full week in part application for the band in` y band
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

§§ `26(ה)`

-- (ה): in §11(ב), for a mother employed in part application, 8.6% (תשע"ב),
-- 8.3% (תשע"ג) and 7.6% (תשע"ד) come in place of 7%. §11(ב)'s "larger by
-- 7%" is read as 7 points, as annex א's tables compute it
-- (F-oz-founding-11-a); annexes א'1–א'3 compute (ה)'s rates the same way
-- (95% is paid as 103.60% in תשע"ב, 95.31% as 103.61% in תשע"ג).
@ref akn:art_26__para_e akn:art_26__para_e/p2 akn:art_26__para_e/p3 akn:art_26__para_e/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate section 26(ה) puts in place of 7% in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y (8.6%) (8.3%) (7.6%)

-- Each year's mother's tables add (ה)'s rate (annexes א'1–א'3).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year's mother's tables add section 26(ה)'s rate` y band IF
    CONSIDER `the mother's tables in part application in` y band
    WHEN JUST m THEN JUST (`the points the mother's tables add` m) EQUALS `the rate section 26(ה) puts in place of 7% in` y
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `the position she works` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the position a mother in part application keeping her week is paid on` y `the position she works` IS
    CONSIDER `the rate section 26(ה) puts in place of 7% in` y
    WHEN JUST r THEN JUST (`the position she works` PLUS r)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `26(ו)`

-- (ו): in §11(ד), for such a mother, "up to a position of 108.6%"
-- (תשע"ב), "108.3%" (תשע"ג) and "107.6%" (תשע"ד) come in place of 107%:
-- employment under §11 up to that position needs no special approval of
-- the Ministry. Each cap is the position (ה) gives a full-time mother that
-- year, so it is in (an exception to convention thresholds.until, as in
-- §11(ד)).
@ref akn:art_26__para_f akn:art_26__para_f/p2 akn:art_26__para_f/p3 akn:art_26__para_f/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the cap section 26(ו) puts in place of 107% in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y (108.6%) (108.3%) (107.6%)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `the position she is paid on` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 26(ו) spares the Ministry's approval in` y `the position she is paid on` IF
    CONSIDER `the cap section 26(ו) puts in place of 107% in` y
    WHEN JUST cap THEN `the position she is paid on` AT MOST cap
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

§§ `26(ז)`

-- (ז): for a mother in part application, a change of up to 3% in the
-- position from moving between the stages founds no claim. 3% is in (an
-- exception to convention thresholds.until, as in §11(ו)), in points
-- (convention position.points).
@ref akn:art_26__para_g
GIVEN `the position before the move` IS A NUMBER, `the position after the move` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a mother's change of position between stages founds a claim` `the position before the move` `the position after the move` IF
    `the position before the move` MINUS `the position after the move` GREATER THAN 3%
    OR `the position after the move` MINUS `the position before the move` GREATER THAN 3%

§§ `26(ח)`

-- (ח): teachers in part application do their bagrut-preparation hours and
-- their homeroom (education) hours in the school in part, by the table: of
-- the bagrut-preparation hours, 1 in תשע"ב, 2 in תשע"ג and 3 in תשע"ד,
-- out of the teacher's own and no more than he was allotted that year; of
-- the homeroom hours, one, two and three. §10's rule that role hours are
-- done in the school gives way to it for these two kinds.
@ref akn:art_26__para_h akn:art_26__para_h/t1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `bagrut-preparation hours allotted to him for the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the bagrut-preparation hours done in the school in part application` y `bagrut-preparation hours allotted to him for the year` IS
    CONSIDER `by the year of part application` y 1 2 3
    WHEN JUST n THEN JUST (min n `bagrut-preparation hours allotted to him for the year`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the homeroom hours done in the school in part application` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y 1 2 3

`doing the year's share of those hours in the school` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `do the year's bagrut-preparation and homeroom hours in the school`

§§ `26(ט)`

-- (ט): the rest of the role hours that come in place of frontal hours, and
-- the role hours that come in place of individual hours, are done in the
-- school in full.
@ref akn:art_26__para_i
`doing the other role hours in the school` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `do the other role hours within the school, in full`

§§ `26(י)`

-- (י): for the weekly presence in the school, at a full or a part-time
-- position, an hour is 60 minutes; the length of a teaching period stays
-- as the Ministry set it.
@ref akn:art_26__para_j
`minutes in an hour of presence in part application` MEANS 60

GIVEN w IS A `Oz work week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of weekly presence in part application` w IS
    `the hours of the Oz week` w TIMES `minutes in an hour of presence in part application`

§§ `26 -- illustrations`

-- A teacher who taught for one of the employers on both eves: an existing
-- teacher.
`a teacher teaching on both eves` MEANS
    `Oz staff member` WITH
        `as section 2 sees them`                    IS `a covered upper-division employee in` `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12`
        `teaches grades 10 to 14`                   IS TRUE
        `teaches grade 9`                           IS FALSE
        `serves as a school principal`              IS FALSE
        `appointed principal by the employer's rules` IS FALSE
        `standing on the eve of signing`            IS `teaching for one of the employers`
        `standing on the eve of moving to the reform` IS `teaching for one of the employers`
        `began with one of the employers in 5772 to 5775` IS FALSE
        `teaching years recognised for salary seniority` IS 0
        `of them an internship year`                IS 0
        `of them teaching in army or national service` IS 0
        `of them seniority for compulsory army or national service` IS 0
        `first appointed a principal in 5772`       IS FALSE
        `under the reform in 5772, fully or in part` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `a teacher in the Oz part application in` `the school year 5772` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT NOT `a teacher in the Oz part application in` `the school year 5775` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT NOT `a teacher in the Oz part application in` `the school year 5773` `a teacher hired in 5773 after an internship year` `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT NOT `a teacher in the Oz part application in` `the school year 5772` (`a serving principal of` `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12`) `the Oz reform in part`
-- (א): 30, 32 and 36 hours; the support hours add up; the table is (א)
#ASSERT `the hours of the full-position week in part application in` `the school year 5772` EQUALS JUST 30
#ASSERT `the hours of the full-position week in part application in` `the school year 5773` EQUALS JUST 32
#ASSERT `the hours of the full-position week in part application in` `the school year 5774` EQUALS JUST 36
#ASSERT `the support hours of part application add up in` `the school year 5772` AND `the support hours of part application add up in` `the school year 5773` AND `the support hours of part application add up in` `the school year 5774`
#ASSERT map JUST `the weeks section 26(א)'s table prints` EQUALS map `the full-position week in part application in` (LIST `the school year 5772`, `the school year 5773`, `the school year 5774`)
-- the frontal hours are §9(ו)'s 24 in every year
#ASSERT all (GIVEN w YIELD w's `frontal teaching hours` EQUALS `the Oz full-position week`'s `frontal teaching hours`) `the weeks section 26(א)'s table prints`
-- each year's annex opens at (א)'s week; annex ג'1's second column, 23 + 2
-- + 3.5 hours, is a position of 95.00%: 28.5 of the 30 hours, where of
-- §9(א)'s 40 it would be 71.25%
#ASSERT `the year's annex opens at section 26(א)'s week` `the school year 5772` AND `the year's annex opens at section 26(א)'s week` `the school year 5773` AND `the year's annex opens at section 26(א)'s week` `the school year 5774`
#ASSERT `a part-time teacher's week in part application` `the school year 5772` 23 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 23 2 3.5) (95%) (95%))
#ASSERT `a part-time teacher's week in part application` `the school year 5775` 23 EQUALS NOTHING
-- (ה)–(ו): annex א'1 pays 95% as 103.60%, annex א'2 95.31% as 103.61%;
-- each year's cap is 100% and (ה)'s rate
#ASSERT `the position a mother in part application keeping her week is paid on` `the school year 5772` (95%) EQUALS JUST (103.60%)
#ASSERT `the position a mother in part application keeping her week is paid on` `the school year 5773` (95.31%) EQUALS JUST (103.61%)
#ASSERT `the position a mother in part application keeping her week is paid on` `the school year 5774` (100%) EQUALS `the cap section 26(ו) puts in place of 107% in` `the school year 5774`
#ASSERT `section 26(ו) spares the Ministry's approval in` `the school year 5772` (108.6%)
-- (ד)–(ו) against annexes א'1–א'3 and ב'1–ב'3: each year's mother's tables
-- open at the band's week, add (ה)'s rate in every band, and pay a
-- full-time mother (ו)'s cap; the age tables open at the band's week —
-- but annex ב'3's over 55, which prints 6 individual hours where (א) and
-- §12 give 5 (F-oz-founding-annex-g-a), and is read with 5.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD all (GIVEN band YIELD `the year's mother's tables open at the band's week` y band) `the Oz age bands`) (LIST `the school year 5772`, `the school year 5773`, `the school year 5774`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD all (GIVEN band YIELD `the year's mother's tables add section 26(ה)'s rate` y band) `the Oz age bands`) (LIST `the school year 5772`, `the school year 5773`, `the school year 5774`)
#ASSERT `a mother's week in part application, keeping her week` `the school year 5772` `the Oz band under 50` 24 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 24 2 4) (100%) (108.6%))
#ASSERT `a mother's week in part application, keeping her week` `the school year 5773` `the Oz band under 50` 24 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 24 3 5) (100%) (108.3%))
#ASSERT `a mother's week in part application, keeping her week` `the school year 5774` `the Oz band under 50` 24 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 24 5 7) (100%) (107.6%))
#ASSERT `the cap section 26(ו) puts in place of 107% in` `the school year 5773` EQUALS JUST (108.3%)
#ASSERT `the week of the annexed table's full position` `the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55` EQUALS `the full week in part application for the band in` `the school year 5772` `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
#ASSERT `the week of the annexed table's full position` `the table of annex ב'2 over 55` EQUALS `the full week in part application for the band in` `the school year 5773` `the Oz band over 55`
#ASSERT `the week of the annexed table's full position` `the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55` EQUALS `the full week in part application for the band in` `the school year 5774` `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
#ASSERT NOT `the week of the annexed table's full position` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55` EQUALS `the full week in part application for the band in` `the school year 5774` `the Oz band over 55`
