-- F-oz-founding-26-a's evidence: part ג, which the opening applies, puts a
-- full position at 40 weekly hours and has §9(ד) complete the 40, while
-- (א)'s full week in תשע"ב is 30 hours, and §9(ב)'s days with a long day
-- free already hold 37: read to 40, §9(ד) would ask 3 hours more than the
-- 37; read to (א)'s week, none.
`section 26 leaves section 9's 40 hours beside its own week` MEANS
        `the Oz position base` EQUALS 40
    AND `the hours of the full-position week in part application in` `the school year 5772` EQUALS JUST 30
    AND `the Oz position base` MINUS `the hours §9(ב)'s days hold with a long day free` EQUALS 3
    AND `the hours section 9(ד) completes in part application in` `the school year 5772` EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `section 26 leaves section 9's 40 hours beside its own week`
